1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:03,590
(Howard:)My mom's been
kind of an emotional wreck...

2
00:00:03,766 --> 00:00:06,756
(Howard:)...since that dentist she was dating
dumped her.

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:09,770
(Raj:)Dumped her? What did he use, a forklift?

4
00:00:12,475 --> 00:00:13,905
(Raj:)Sorry.

5
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,770
(Raj:)There's nothing funny
about morbid obesity.

6
00:00:17,313 --> 00:00:19,283
(Howard:)She's huge, it was funny.

7
00:00:20,149 --> 00:00:23,849
(Howard:)Anyway, I was just hoping that maybe you
could check in on her tomorrow night...

8
00:00:24,087 --> 00:00:27,917
(Howard:)...make sure she's doing okay.
- Dude, I'm a single man.

9
00:00:28,124 --> 00:00:30,614
(Raj:)Saturday night is my party night.

10
00:00:31,461 --> 00:00:33,661
Really, what do you got going on?

11
00:00:33,863 --> 00:00:36,123
(Raj:)I don't know, maybe drive
down to Hollywood...

12
00:00:36,299 --> 00:00:38,629
(Raj:)...hit a few hot spots,
see if I can get lucky.

13
00:00:39,369 --> 00:00:42,199
Tell me if this sounds familiar. Ahem.

14
00:00:42,939 --> 00:00:45,969
You pay $15 to park,
you stand on the sidewalk for an hour...

15
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:49,005
(Howard:)...until you break down and
give the bouncer 20 to let you in.

16
00:00:49,212 --> 00:00:52,652
(Howard:)You push your way to the bar
where you drink an $18 cosmopolitan.

17
00:00:52,849 --> 00:00:56,289
(Howard:)Then you stare at a pretty girl
and imagine your perfect life together.

18
00:00:56,486 --> 00:00:59,286
(Howard:)Children, grandchildren.
Meanwhile, she leaves with a guy...

